TITLE:: CloudView
summary:: Cloud's display
categories:: Libraries>Cloud
related:: Classes/Cloud, Classes/FxParamView, Classes/FxParamPanel

DESCRIPTION::
What link::Classes/FxParamPanel:: puts at the top of Cloud's window. In it, drag left and right for the position, up and down for the pitch; the wheel for the scatter in time. The dots are drawn from the settings: they say what the cloud is doing, they do not report each grain the server makes.

It draws from the object's settings and the replies its meters bring, so it is only live while the window is running; link::Classes/FxParamView:: has the rest.

